  "title": "MIDI: Move packet-sysex.c to packet-midi.c.",
  "description": "We really need a home for MIDI functionality shared/shareable between RTP-MIDI\nand USBAudio MIDI.  At the same time, it seems a bit weird having just MIDI\nSysEx stuff in its own standalone file, so let's use the SysEx code as the\nstarting point for the common MIDI code, moving it from packet-sysex.c to\npacket-midi.c for that purpose.\n\nJust rearranging files (and minimally updating the file header comments) for\nnow.  Further refactoring and adjustments to follow...\n\nThis is followup from discussion in !22141.",
